    "releaseDate": null,
    "description": "Collects events from a Secure Firewall Management Center (FMC) over eStreamer: connection, policy violation, VPN login/logoff, FireAMP, file, intrusion and intrusion packet events. For Splunk as sourcetype cisco:sfw:estreamer, with the field names the Cisco Security Cloud app maps to CIM (that app is required on the search heads for CIM mapping), and/or as CEF files for a syslog agent. Inputs, client certificates and collector status are managed in Splunk Web. Independent project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Cisco.",
    "classification": {
      "intendedAudience": "Security",
